## 2. Summoning
### Rarity distribution
- 3-star / Rare: **78%**.
- 4-star / Epic: **19.9%**.
- 5-star / Legendary: **2%**.
- 6-star / Secret: **0.1%**.
- Total: 100%. Owner's correction adds 10 percentage points to **3-star**, not 6-star.

### Banners and payments
- **Standard**: within each rarity, divide 100% of that rarity's probability equally among eligible operators.
- **Featured = Special banner**: features one 5-star OR one 6-star. Conditional on pulling that rarity, featured operator has 50%; remaining 50% is split equally among other eligible operators of that rarity. Loss guarantee can override this normal selection.
- **Daily**: ordinary distribution matches Standard. Receive one Daily ticket per day; unused ticket expires, never accumulates. No Diamond payment, Mileage or 5-/6-star pity credit.
- Summon options: 1× and 10×. Single = one applicable ticket OR 300 Diamonds, except Daily forbids Diamonds. Ten results cost nine tickets or nine rolls' Diamond cost; derived = **2,700 Diamonds**.
- Daily cannot save tickets for a 10×; no alternative Daily 10× mechanism is specified.
- OPEN: eligible pools and featured exclusivity.

### Mileage shop — separate from pity
- Each non-Daily summon earns **one Mileage ticket**. Derived: ten-result summon earns ten; owner did not separately restate bundle earnings.
- Mileage persists across banner changes and is spent manually in a redemption shop; thresholds do not automatically award operators.
- **250 Mileage**: featured 5-star, available only when a 5-star is featured.
- **2,500 Mileage**: 6-star redemption, available only when a 6-star is featured. Original source offers featured OR random 6-star; random option has not explicitly been removed, so its continued availability remains OPEN.
- Featured 6-star blocks 5-star redemption; featured 5-star blocks 6-star redemption.

### Guarantees
- One Epic/4-star per 10-pull.
- One 5-star per 100 rolls; one Secret/6-star per 2,000 rolls. Daily excluded from these pity counters.
- 5-star pity resets each banner. OPEN: application to permanent Standard banner.
- After losing first featured 50/50, second is guaranteed. WORKING: next outcome of the featured rarity is featured; not an immediate high-rarity guarantee on the next roll.
- OPEN: whether ten singles qualify for Epic guarantee; higher-rarity substitution; shared Standard/Featured counters; resets after early high-rarity pulls; 6-star pity carry-over; lost-50/50 carry-over. Mileage persistence does not establish pity persistence.

